                                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from Valeria named Valeria: Play No sound and display ExSoundString.  Modify duration: Set to ExSoundDuration seconds and Wait
                                -------- ===================================== --------
                        -------- ====================== --------
                        -------- Run "Create Dialog" --------
